{"_id":"69440ca65e6c74e9c1972d93","title":"LedZ Civ V3.4 (UPD!)","game":{"_id":"68585116ac15ee5efb80b9ce","gameId":102829972707814,"name":"[UPD] civilization survival game","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7fec7aa2e32cf8814ad50a87a0ca71d90df757e86861b298d31d2291713ee295.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac9a01b8f26e9a1a5255122a03cc2c05/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"102829972707814-civilization-survival-game","path":"/game/102829972707814-civilization-survival-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7fec7aa2e32cf8814ad50a87a0ca71d90df757e86861b298d31d2291713ee295.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac9a01b8f26e9a1a5255122a03cc2c05/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":102829972707814},"slug":"civilization-survival-game-LedZ-Civ-75902","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":7293,"executes":4176,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0d92ab526ebfe71548592ebff1c24dec94f7e1fc08a516a49ef54ebf65dfe04e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/102829972707814-1787823492440.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/102829972707814-1787823492440.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0d92ab526ebfe71548592ebff1c24dec94f7e1fc08a516a49ef54ebf65dfe04e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/102829972707814-1787823492440.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/102829972707814-1787823492440.jpg"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-12-18T14:16:06.933Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-18T14:16:06.933Z","lastBump":"2025-12-18T14:16:06.933Z","script":"-- join the discord for more news/updates!\n-- best run on real/madium\n-- mobile soon\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leodoscripts/CIv/refs/heads/main/Survival%20Game%20UD\"))()","features":"Movement\n  - Speed Boost (multiplier + jitter), No Slow, Infinite Jump\n  - CFrame Fly (WASD + Space/Shift) with speed slider\n  - Noclip, Ghost (stealth CFrame speed, 4 stealth levels)\n  - CFrame Speed (jitter), CFrame Fly (noclip + jitter)\n\n  Survival\n  - Infinite Water (auto-drink), Auto Hunger (auto-eat)\n  - Auto Prompts (with a safe \"respect hold time\" option)\n  - Keep Backpack Open, Anti-Grab (escape when carried)\n\n  Visuals\n  - Player ESP: names + distance, boxes, health bars, chams, distance slider\n  - Town ESP, Rock ESP (stone nodes)\n  - Loot ESP (dropped items, pick which item, show distance)\n  - Hitbox Expander (size, visible box, transparency)\n\n  Combat\n\n  Fight\n  - Spear Silent Aim: prediction, lead, range, team check, auto-throw at nearest\n  - Buttons: Throw At Nearest, Shield Up/Down, Kick Shields, Toggle Friendly Fire\n  - Auto Kick and Auto Shield, each with its own team check and range (works on mobile)\n  - Auto-Equip Strongest Weapon When Hit\n  - Panic: rise up now, auto-rise at low HP, hover, HP threshold, rise height\n\n  Ghost\n  - Ghost Kill: follow a target from underground or above, with target hitbox radius\n\n  World\n\n  - Deploy: plant saplings near you, where you stand, at the town root, at the mouse, auto-plant around you, ring around\n    the town hall\n  - Trader: trade all affordable once, or auto-trade on an interval\n  - Jobs: create your own civ, join a team/civ, pick a job\n  - Misc:\n    - Withdraw all from storage, leader announcement logger\n    - Mobile Shield/Kick buttons: draggable, tap or hold, adjustable size\n    - Item ESP for gear on the map: off-screen arrows, walk to nearest\n    - Performance: no menu blur, no shadows\n    - Rejoin, Server Hop, Unload\n\n  Farm\n\n  Auto Farm\n  - Farm any resource: trees, stone, ores, fiber, wheat, corn\n  - Replant saplings, pick-up list, farm near your town hall first\n  - Haul logs to the town hall\n  - Build Anything: mark a spot (mouse, in front, or tap), rotate, then it places, gathers and delivers materials. Can\n    also continue the nearest unfinished site.\n  - Auto Pickup Nearby, Harvest Aura, debug log\n\n  Goal\n  - Pick any craftable item and amount, show the full plan, then Run Goal. It gathers, switches jobs at your town hall's\n    job board, and crafts.\n  - Fiber, wheat and corn are picked by hand (no sickle needed)\n  - Inventory:\n    - Inventory Glitch (~20 slots)\n    - Use the chest when full, store non-goal items, take stored items back out\n  - Walk to job board and switch job\n\n  Smart Plant\n  - Plant at the mouse or in front of you, mark spots and plant them all, or plant every sapling in a grid\n  - Retry settings: spacing, step, radius, max tries, cooldown\n\n  Travel\n  - Smart Walk (pathfinding + climbing) to the nearest well, crafting table, blacksmith, etc.\n  - Auto Loot Best Gear from death drops (only grabs upgrades, set range and hold time)\n  - Calibrated Speed (auto-calibrate, backs off when the server snaps you back)\n  - Resource ESP (pick resources, planted saplings, range, max labels)\n  - World: Fullbright, No Fog, hide hunger/thirst effects, Custom FOV, Anti-AFK","tags":["OP","keyless","civ","free"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/RNegDurwtU","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/RNegDurwtU","owner":{"_id":"693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63","username":"LedZLed","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0bb5be3d0f37ce9cd8a09e3e68f48798e3195c0010f6b741839eb1051b1c06c6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63-1766067560784.jpg"},"lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0bb5be3d0f37ce9cd8a09e3e68f48798e3195c0010f6b741839eb1051b1c06c6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693acdfa06da572cb7fffc63-1766067560784.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-16T10:56:38.547Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false